            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86370, Woven Carbon Fiber Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Knob has a uniquely modern appearance granted to it my the woven carbon fiber material displayed in the center. This Carbon Fiber Silver Knob is available in 2 sizes. It comes packaged with the installation hardware. Choose from Satin Nickel or Polished Chrome. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/carbon-fiber-silver-bar-cabinet-pull-emtek-86385\"><b>Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/silver-carbon-fiber-bin-pull-emtek-86374\"><b>Silver Carbon Fiber Bin Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Carbon Fiber Knob in Silver:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Carbon Fiber and Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86370-specifications.pdf?v=1704262406\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86370-specifications.jpg?v=1704354655\" width=\"600\" height=\"191\" boarder=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86370 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86370:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86371:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
